{"4083950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Little Cat Things", "steam_appid": 4083950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/f08b8c6fe4bf029c5e4b24e972fa7795.avif?t=1781085111\" width=650 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/1fd7ad8c34b7ff229956e56fd57e32e4.webp?t=1781085111\" width=24 height=26 /></span> <strong>The Way of Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A survival RPG about a stray cat trying to stay alive in the concrete wild.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten alleys and neon-lit rooftops — hunt, trade, and shamelessly liberate supplies from<br> careless humans to secure the essentials of meow-life.Stay healthy in both body and mind, and tend<br> to wounds as you struggle to survive one day at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/3e0c7c464e48b3878966429328adc2a2.poster.avif?t=1781085111\" width=702 height=395 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/3e0c7c464e48b3878966429328adc2a2.webm?t=1781085111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/44eb0e66a9a170b8064e84e432565d38.webp?t=1781085111\" width=650 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/1fd7ad8c34b7ff229956e56fd57e32e4.webp?t=1781085111\" width=24 height=26 /></span> <strong>Unexpected Talents：Skills No Cat Should Realistically Have</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you’ll master unlikely skills—from farming and arcane magic to even a second language. Evolve into an absurdly capable feline who is always one paw ahead at the starting line.  <br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/b4d6c77a8d5afcaf9c51ccf4611dde34.poster.avif?t=1781085111\" width=702 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/b4d6c77a8d5afcaf9c51ccf4611dde34.webm?t=1781085111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/44eb0e66a9a170b8064e84e432565d38.webp?t=1781085111\" width=650 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/1fd7ad8c34b7ff229956e56fd57e32e4.webp?t=1781085111\" width=24 height=26 /></span><strong> Feline Friends &amp; Canine Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll meet cats and dogs fighting for their own place in the city.<br>Some will stand beside you with warmth and loyalty — others may smile while planning betrayal.<br>Every choice you make quietly reshapes their fate… and yours.<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/9e02849c5f0f257f5c6af19fadb01bab.poster.avif?t=1781085111\" width=702 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/9e02849c5f0f257f5c6af19fadb01bab.webm?t=1781085111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/44eb0e66a9a170b8064e84e432565d38.webp?t=1781085111\" width=650 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/1fd7ad8c34b7ff229956e56fd57e32e4.webp?t=1781085111\" width=24 height=26 /></span><strong> Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience humor, absurdity, wonder, and sorrow woven through the city’s night.<br>Can you unravel the truth beneath countless intersecting events?<br>Can you heal not only yourself, but the lonely and broken lives around you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of a stray —<br>but survival is something every soul in the city must learn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/44eb0e66a9a170b8064e84e432565d38.webp?t=1781085111\" width=650 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083950/extras/f08b8c6fe